The first is "aba".
The second is "cdc".
The firstlast is the last position of first.
The secondlast is the last position of second.
The firstsize is 0.
For every spot from 0 to firstlast.
Add 1 to firstsize.

The secondsize is 0.
For every spot from 0 to secondlast.
Add 1 to secondsize.

If first matches second, show -1.
If first does not match second, The answer is the larger of firstsize and secondsize, show answer.
